config OPENCOLLAR_BENCH_BOUNDARY
	bool "Bench boundary from src/boundary_local.h"
	help
	  Load the boundary in src/boundary_local.h (gitignored) as version 0,
	  in RAM only, when no boundary is in force. For trying the fence and
	  cues on the bench without a server. Off on real collars, which never
	  invent a fence.

